  "description": "Operating Area: Naples, Italy, Olbia, Sardinia\n\nCustom Line 106’ MARICAN FOREVER is a new horizon in yachting excellence, with clean, crisp lines and palatial spaces of essential sophistication. She offers unsurpassable comfort for her guests.\n\nThe minimalist design melds interior and exterior into a single elegant whole. The generous floor-to-ceiling windows on the main deck let the sun filter through so that you can revel in every ripple. The lower-deck features 2 VIP cabins and 2 Twins, where light is king once again. The Master cabin is situated on the main deck.\n\nThe stern features a cozy lounge area with a sofa, while the flybridge offers a spacious dining area that comfortably seats 12 guests. Moving forward, there are additional spaces designed for relaxation and leisure. The bow connects seamlessly to the flybridge, sheltered by two side windows and enhanced by a sleek hardtop with paired skylights, creating an exclusive spot for enjoying breathtaking panoramic views of the sea.\n\nStabilisers offer even greater comfort while at rest. MARICAN FOREVER offers a wide selection of water toys.\n\nShe is equipped with Starlink high speed internet.",
